# Accessibility-Considerations
in order to add more accessibility i will add clear and defined features for the blind such as proper alt text coding and descriptions as well as a format that is manageable with a screen reader that defines what the user is looking at or hovering on
as well as those with color blindness, i will follow standards for a triple A WCAG compliance on text and pages for proper color and view ability of the pages I create
I will be considerate of those who may be disabled or unable to use a website in a more traditional sense and design them around the principle of accessibility and make easy for anyone and everyone to use.
